  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tho̱p Yecu kɛ rɔ ala muc kä kɛɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ŋuɔ̱t min ɛ ti̱eep ŋɔaani ti gɔw ti bi ben kärɔa, a /ciɛ jɛn thuɔ̱k kä ti̱ti̱, /cɛ nɛy tin ti̱eckɛ rɔ̱ Kuoth dee met jakä gɔw a thil diw, kɛ tho̱p mucni ti̱ti̱ runi diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci nɛy tin palkɛ Kuoth gɔaa kä dueerkiɛn, /cikɛ dee lɛ ŋot kɛ mi tekɛ kɛ duer, kä dee muc diaal cu cuɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö kɛn muc ti̱ti̱ ti̱emkɛ kɛ ɣöö tekɛ kɛ dueer runi diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bumɛ ɛn ɣöö bi riɛm thääkni kɛnɛ det dueer luäŋ kɛ wuɔ̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ, mëë ci Kritho ben rɛy ɣɔaa, cuɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:5-7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 40:6-8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bööth palä diaal cuŋkɛ lätnikiɛn ni ciaŋ, kä nyiöökɛ muc kɛ tho̱p gua̱thni diaal, ti /ca dueer dee met luäŋ kɛ wuɔ̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Kritho muc kɛl thöp kɛ kui̱ dueeri, cuɛ nyuur kui̱c cuëëc Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn li̱pɛ ɛn wi̱ni amäni mi wa ji̱ tɛ̈rɛ jakä cääk ciöknikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ jɛn muc ɔ kɛl ɔ cuɛ nɛy tin cɛ lɛy jakä gɔw kɛ run diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ cɛ kɔn la̱t ruac ɛmɛ bä, kɛ kɔr kä mëë cɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiëëknɛ rɔ̱ kɛ Kuoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ dämaari, ta̱nɛ kɛ ŋa̱th kɛ wädan rɛy gua̱th in rɛl rɔ kɛ riɛm Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cɛ kɔn lëp duɔ̱ɔ̱p mi pay tuɔɔk mi tëk, kɛ geel, min la puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ta̱nɛ kɛ bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t min te ruac dhɔaar Kuɔth kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ti̱ecnɛ rɔ̱ thiäkä kɛ lo̱c ti thuɔ̱ɔ̱k, kɛnɛ ŋa̱th mi ro̱ŋ, kɛ lo̱ckɔn ti ca jakä puɔth kä mi jiääk, kɛnɛ pua̱nykɔn ti ca lak kɛ pi̱ ti wi̱er wi̱eer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuanɛ ŋa̱thdan in latnɛ käp a bum a thil guɛ̈l, kɛ ɣöö jɛn ram in ci ruacdɛ lat ŋääthɛ rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuanɛ diɛɛr kɛ rɔ kä lua̱knɛ rɔ̱ kä nyuɔthnɛ nhök kɛnɛ lät ti gɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ ma̱tdan kɛ̈ɛ̈l päl, ce̱tkɛ ciaŋ in tekɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nath, kä cuɔmnɛ rɔ̱ ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö nɛ̈nɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ci cäŋ thia̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö mi duernɛ a ŋa̱cnɛ, kɛ kɔr kä min canɛ ŋäc thukä jek, thilɛ muc mi ci duɔth kɛ kui̱ dueeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ mi ci duɔth ɛ ni li̱ep dualä kɛ luk in bi ben kɛnɛ maac in bi ji̱ tɛ̈r Kuoth waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi ci ciaŋ ŋuɔ̱t Muthɛ to̱l bɛ li̱w a thil kɔ̱a̱c lɔaac kɛ ruac nëëni da̱ŋ rɛw kiɛ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuɛ tɔ̱a̱ŋ mi jiääk mi te di ɛnɔ caarɛ mɔ i̱ ba jek ɛ nɛy tin /ca Gat Kuɔth luth, kä guɛckɛ riɛm matdä ruac ëë ca lɛy ni kɛ ce̱tkɛ mi /ciɛ mi gɔaa, kä kueth Yiëë nho̱kä Kuɔth? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ŋa̱cnɛ ram ëë lar jɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t 32:35-36.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Cut ɛ duŋdä, bä jɛ dhil kɛ cuɔ̱l.” Kä laarɛ jɛ bä i̱, “Bi Kuäär ni Kuoth nɛɛkɛ luk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ dual mi di̱i̱t ɛn ɣöö bi raan pɛn tetdä Kuɔth in tëk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tiɛmɛ ni̱n tëë kɔn, tëë cia ruut ni rik ti ŋuan ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m, kɛ kɔr kä mëë cia thuɔ̱k ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ gua̱thni ca yɛ yak, kä ca yɛ moc ti bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c nhiam nath, kä kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ gua̱thni cia te kɛɛl kɛ nɛy ti ca ciɛŋ a jiäk inɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu lo̱ckun luäk ji̱ yieenä go̱r, kä cia kuäk nyinikun rut kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac, kɛ ɣöö yɛn pua̱nykun cia jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ta̱yɛ kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r mi gɔaa ni jɛn, kä te thi̱n ni ciaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
